# DRIFTLINE: the game completed in co-op. The demo player drives both cars
# (one switch tells it to press the second pad's buttons too) through all
# four stages to the ending, with real presses.
game driftline
wait 12
press DOWN
cheat bot2
botuntil state == 6 70000
expect players == 2
expect won == 1
expect goals & 2
print score
print deaths
print coins
print frame
